%% Figure 5.7 - Sequence diagram
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant API as FastAPI decisions.py
  participant P as Pipeline (background)
  participant R as Redis
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant M as src/ models
  B->>API: POST /analyze
  API->>DB: INSERT decision
  API-->>B: 202 {decision_id}
  B->>API: GET /stream (SSE)
  API->>R: replay backlog + subscribe
  API->>P: BackgroundTask
  loop five steps
    P->>DB: SELECT decision (RLS)
    P->>M: predict / simulate / explain
    P->>DB: UPDATE step columns
    P->>R: publish {step, done}
    R-->>API: event
    API-->>B: data: {step, status}
  end
  P->>DB: INSERT audit_logs
  P->>R: publish complete
  B->>API: GET /result
